    kind: work_item  # d917
    title: "stable_id: http/sql call_site stand-ins hash endpoint/query content, omit path → cross-file SITE-axis collisions (31 nodes, Wave-2 gate)"  # d917
    status: todo_hard  # d917
    priority: 1  # d917
    parent: INV-tazaj-bufod-dinuh-damoh-lubaf-zadod-jisav-duzuj  # d917
