  message: "DONE in v8 (PR merged @ selfh/dev 0d740169bf). New make_site_stable_id(protocol_origin, rel_path, target) factory path-anchors the http (http.py:1338) + sql (database_query.py:373) call_sites at mint (site: namespace). BEHAVIORAL EVIDENCE: Wave-2 gate re-run on the identical 27-repo cohort — http/sql call_site cross-file collisions went to 0 (httpx 1->0, koel 4->0, sqlalchemy 3->0, caddy http 2->0, SELF call_site 5->0). Per-file occurrence still completed downstream by split_within_file_stable_id_collisions. Adversarially verified high-confidence; the cross-file http test inverted (test_same_url_different_files_distinct_stable_id) + a same-file-same-id guard added."  # f8d3
